Z||000001||Stoic||12-09-2000||10:02 PM||||16x7s will fit.  As far as lowering goes, the Fiero Store <A HREF="http://www.fierostore.com/pegasus/indexhome.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fierostore.com/pegasus/indexhome.html</A>  offers Elbach lowering springs (up to 1" drop)for $249.oo for front and rear.  Hope that helps...||||reg||1
